==English==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|la|ipse dīxit||he himself said it}}, {{calque|en|grc|αὐτὸς ἔφα|nocap=1}}.<br/>Originally used by the followers of {{l|en|Pythagoreanism}}, who claimed this or that proposition to be uttered by {{l|en|Pythagoras}} himself. Extended during the Middle Ages to the statements of {{l|en|Aristotle}}, and more famously used in such contexts.

